      "text": "Hello everyone, my name is Alaricus and today I'll be sharing my journey with artificial intelligence. How it's impacted my life, the way I see the world and the projects and achievements that came out of it. It has been more than just coding and working for me. It's been a way to take ideas in my head and turn them into something new. Stop me problem solving creativity and teamwork. I've also learned that AI isn't just about the future. It's something young people like me can use right now to create real solutions for real problems. For us the youth, AI is opening doors that didn't exist before, giving us opportunities to innovate, to complete globally,",
