      "text": "and to see ourselves as creators, not just consumers of technology. AI is hoping young people dream bigger whether it's in healthcare, education, or in my case protecting the environment. Through my work with AI and robotics, I've been fortunate to achieve some milestones that I'm really proud of. I came second place in programming engineering and robotics at the Irene Sense Expo, which was held last year, and I also placed third in AI programming and engineering at the African Sense Basket Competition. And most importantly, I became the National Champion of the First Legal League, Zimbabwe with my team's project, an AI part C serverless system that detects any most litter from the ocean.",
