      "text": "Along with competitions, I'm also the captain of my school's coding and robotics club. Leading the club has been just as important to me as competing because it's about sharing knowledge, inspiring my teammates, and showing others that AI is something we can all explore. My team and I are also an example of the positive impacts that AI can make on young people. Together we became National Champions of the First Legal League Zimbabwe with a project we designed also, an AI part C serverless and litter detection system. The idea came from realizing how serious the problem of ocean pollution is, because every year millions of tons of plastic end up in the water, harming marine life, and even affecting human health.",
