      "text": "So we wanted to see how AI could help fight this problem, and our system uses cameras and AI models such as Yolo V5 to scan the surface of the sea, detect pieces of litter and even guide our robot mechanism to move it. In a way, it's like giving the ocean a pair of smart eyes and hands to protect itself. And what makes it fascinating is that it's not just about cleaning the ocean, it's about creating a solution that can work 24-7. Learn from the environment and scale up in the future. For us, it was proof that young people, even at 16, can design technology that tackles global issues. And that's what excites me the most about AI.",
